     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap who-ddcc-map-eudcc-icd11-vaccines</b></p><a name=\"who-ddcc-map-eudcc-icd11-vaccines\"> </a><a name=\"hcwho-ddcc-map-eudcc-icd11-vaccines\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-WHODDCCeuur.html\">EUUR codes used in this IG</a> to <code>http://id.who.int/icd11/mms</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Covaxin</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM1NL1</td></tr><tr><td>Covishield</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM9QW8</td></tr><tr><td>Sputnik-V</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM9QW8</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/20/1528 (Comirnaty)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM0GQ8</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/20/1525 (Jcovden)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM0CX4</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/20/1507 (Spikevax)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM0GQ8</td></tr><tr><td>EU/1/21/1529 (Vaxzevria)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM9QW8</td></tr><tr><td>CoronaVac</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM1NL1</td></tr><tr><td>BBIBP-CorV</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM1NL1</td></tr><tr><td>Convidecia</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>XM9QW8</td></tr><tr><td>NVX-CoV2373</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>XM5JC5</td></tr></table></div>"
